<p>Start traveling on the world map to the location clicked. If a random encounter area tag and waypoint tag were specified then travel on the world map and have a random encounter at the specified location. Otherwise, sends the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/EVENT%20TYPE%20FINISH%20TRAVEL" title="EVENT TYPE FINISH TRAVEL">EVENT_TYPE_FINISH_TRAVEL</a> event when completed.
</p>
